  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:28.660" end="00:31.900" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="00:31.900" end="00:35.130" ttm:agent="v1">I think you come from another world</p>
      <p begin="00:35.130" end="00:38.770" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="00:38.770" end="00:42.930" ttm:agent="v1">I really don't understand a word</p>
      <p begin="00:42.930" end="00:45.930" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="00:45.930" end="00:50.940" ttm:agent="v1">I'd like to shake you around and around</p>
      <p begin="00:50.940" end="00:53.740" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="00:53.740" end="00:58.730" ttm:agent="v1">I'd like to turn you all upside down</p>
      <p begin="00:58.730" end="01:00.620" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="01:00.620" end="01:05.880" ttm:agent="v1">The way you look like you do</p>
      <p begin="01:05.880" end="01:08.180" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="01:08.180" end="01:13.230" ttm:agent="v1">I want to be with you</p>
      <p begin="01:13.230" end="01:16.620" ttm:agent="v1">I think I'm falling, I think I'm falling in</p>
      <p begin="01:16.620" end="01:20.710" ttm:agent="v1">I think I'm falling in love with you, with you</p>
      <p begin="01:20.710" end="01:24.890" ttm:agent="v1">I think I'm falling, I think I'm falling in</p>
      <p begin="01:24.890" end="01:32.890" ttm:agent="v1">I think I'm falling in love with you</p>
      <p begin="01:52.360" end="01:55.220" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="01:55.220" end="01:59.010" ttm:agent="v1">I think you come from another world</p>
      <p begin="01:59.010" end="02:02.930" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="02:02.930" end="02:07.250" ttm:agent="v1">I really don't understand a word</p>
      <p begin="02:07.250" end="02:09.970" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="02:09.970" end="02:14.650" ttm:agent="v1">I'd like to shake you around and around</p>
      <p begin="02:14.650" end="02:17.610" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="02:17.610" end="02:23.210" ttm:agent="v1">I'd like to turn you all upside down</p>
      <p begin="02:23.210" end="02:24.710" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="02:24.490" end="02:29.900" ttm:agent="v1">The way you look like you do</p>
      <p begin="02:29.900" end="02:32.050" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="02:32.050" end="02:37.500" ttm:agent="v1">I want to be with you</p>
      <p begin="02:37.500" end="02:39.450" ttm:agent="v1">You're such a strange girl</p>
      <p begin="02:39.450" end="02:44.540" ttm:agent="v1">The way you look like you do</p>
